# Game_Pitstop — Pit Stop Simulator (ID 28)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Pitstop.h, Game_Pitstop.cpp
# HTML: data/game_pitstop_setup.html, game_pitstop_names.html, game_pitstop_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Pit stop racing simulator. Players trigger entry/exit pit sequences with countdowns.
Standard mode: 1 puck/player. Pit-lane mode: separate entry + exit pucks.
Optional status puck shows pit availability.

## CONFIG
- numPlayers (1-10), pitstopMs (pit duration * 0.5)
- pitlaneMode: false=1 puck, true=entry+exit pucks
- showCountdown, alwaysYellow (idle color), statusPuckEnabled, statusPuckIdx
- pitlaneExitMs (exit duration * 0.5), exitButtonMode (require press to complete exit)

## STATES
PS_SETUP → PS_RUNNING → PS_PAUSED → PS_FINISHED

## KEY MECHANICS
- Entry: click puck → countdown timer (pitstopMs + penaltyMs)
- Completion: DINGDONG sound + green DOUBLE_CHASE
- Pit-lane exit: auto-start when clear, or wait if blocked (exitPending)
- exitPending: background timer runs, subtracts elapsed when blocker finishes
- Idle pucks blink: 333ms on / 666ms off, color = yellow or player color
- Status puck: green=available, yellow=all busy, red=paused
- Pause: freeze all timers, offset on resume
- Penalty: add seconds to running timer, update countdown speed
- Countdown visual: speed = duration / 35

## COMMANDS
cfg_players, cfg_time, cfg_pitlane, cfg_countdown, cfg_alwyellow, cfg_statuspuck_en, cfg_statuspuck,
cfg_exittime, cfg_exitbtn, cfg_entry (slotIdx*100+puckIdx), cfg_exit, start, pause, stop,
penalty (slotIdx*100+seconds), clr_pen, toggle_active, show_track, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{st, total, pit, slots: [{entr, edone, exit, xdone, erem, xrem, sc, act, ewfb, pend, pen}]}
